# `rules.create`

Create a new markdown rule (errors if the id is taken).

**Policy** — command `[C1_WORKSPACE]`. Capability `ship.rules.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `id` | `string` |
| `content` | `string` |
| `scope` | `string` |

## Returns

`ScopedMutation` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `id` | `string` |
| `scope` | `string` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call rules.create --json '{ "id": "", "content": "", "scope": "" }'
```

Kind: command.

## Example response

```json
{
  "id": "no-placeholders",
  "scope": "project"
}
```
